<h3><u>Shakle ali ghazi mera</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><p  'Times New Roman'; line-height: normal; font-size: medium; ""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  'Comic Sans MS'; font-size: large; "">Shakle ali, ghazi mera, qaayam rahe, iski wafa (abbas alam tera, jo log uthayenge) x2</span><br></p><span class=""Apple-style-span""  'Times New Roman'; line-height: normal; font-size: medium; ""><font face=""Comic Sans MS"" size=""4""><ol><li>Zehra ki dua onke, saaye me woh aayenge</li><p>Shakle ali, ghazi mera, qaayam rahe, iski wafa (abbas alam tera, jo log uthayenge) x2</p><li>Tehreer hai dariya pe, ghazi ki wafaa dari. Shabbir tere munkar, kya isko mitaa yenge</li><p>Shakle ali, ghazi mera, qaayam rahe, iski wafa (abbas alam tera, jo log uthayenge) x2</p><li>Hai tujse yehi waadaa, shabbir ki majlis me. Abbas tere gham me, hum khoon bahaa yenge</li><p>Shakle ali, ghazi mera, qaayam rahe, iski wafa (abbas alam tera, jo log uthayenge) x2</p><li>Baazu jo kalam hoker, dariya pe gire tere. Hum hashr talak unkaa, ab soug manaa yenge</li><p>Shakle ali, ghazi mera, qaayam rahe, iski wafa (abbas alam tera, jo log uthayenge) x2</p><li>Zainab ki tamanaa hai, khwaahish hai sakina ki. Har ghar me alam tera, hum log sajaa yenge</li><p>Shakle ali, ghazi mera, qaayam rahe, iski wafa (abbas alam tera, jo log uthayenge) x2</p><li>Khush honga mera ghazi, sarwar bhi dua denge. Paani pe sakina ki, hum nazr dilaa yenge</li></ol><p>Shakle ali, ghazi mera, qaayam rahe, iski wafa (abbas alam tera, jo log uthayenge) x2</p></font></span></p>
                 